        "cooked": "<p>mainly tachyon with unrelenting momentum, as she gets a free attack with every sprint and if she incaps her target, she can get an extra sprint to position. &nbsp;This is opposed to having an extra attack if you had just used the attack action with no target in range. &nbsp;Also, if for some reason you used an overwhelm sprint as prolitariat, sprinting 0 would allow those who are in a good postion to stay there, as unlike scycle formation or brisk effulgence, their is no 'may' on overwhelm's action.</p>",
